      "message": "[warning] Line 107: 🟡 Several mutating paths (`addContact`, `updateConversation`, `removeContact`, `removeContactConversation`, `onTrustRequest`, and `setContacts`) now call `saveContactsLocked()` but ignore its boolean result. When persistence fails, in-memory state and emitted signals proceed as success, causing divergence after restart. **Fix:** propagate/handle save failure consistently (rollback or return false) and avoid emitting success-side callbacks/signals when the save did not persist.",
